<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Shenmue | Forum</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body class="forum-body">
    <header class="header-forum">
        <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    </header>

    <main>
        <img class="ryo" src="images/ryo.png" alt="concept sketch of Ryo">

        <section class="forum-content">

            <h1>Join the conversation</h1>

            <aside>
                <h2>Fun Fact</h2>
                <p>
                    Shenmue began development as a game called Virtua Fighter RPG,
                    featuring Akira Yuki from Sega's Virtua Fighter series. The project
                    eventually evolved into Shenmue, with Ryo Hazuki as its main character.
                </p>
                <a href="https://www.gamedeveloper.com/design/yu-suzuki-recounts-the-making-of-i-shenmue-i-">Game
                    Developer- The Making of Shenmue</a>
            </aside>

            <div>

                <p>
                    Whether you're a longtime fan or discovering Shenmue for
                    the first time, we'd love to hear your thoughts!
                </p>
            </div>

            <!--google form-->
            <iframe
                src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScrg1pxedp0c7_7o_vtBK2iXBOtW1QhiJ-lsGPqs7En1lhC2w/viewform?embedded=true"
                title="Shenmue community discussion form" width="800" height="1000"></iframe>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>